menu "Amity activity control"

config AMITY_ACTIVITY_SETTLE_SECONDS
    int "Activity/standby settling delay (seconds)"
    range 0 120
    default 5
    help
        Ignore requests to change activity until setup transmissions and expected
        replies have finished, followed by this quiet period. Missing replies
        time out after two seconds. Repair requests bypass the guard and do not
        start a new settling period. Set to 0 to disable this guard.

endmenu
